WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.113
This is Echo. Ask it anything about your subjects.

00:00:03.113 --> 00:00:09.027
It answers using school resources and trusted sites, and points you to the right video or page.

00:00:09.027 --> 00:00:11.331
It will not do your homework for you.

00:00:11.331 --> 00:00:14.194
It teaches you how, so you can do it yourself.

00:00:14.194 --> 00:00:17.307
Handy at nine at night when nobody else is around.

00:00:17.307 --> 00:00:20.794
Help is there too, if you get stuck with the app itself.

00:00:20.794 --> 00:00:24.529
Try it now: ask Echo one question you have been putting off.

